        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Update Firefox data for appearance: base-select]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29780</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29780"/>
        <updated>2026-06-01T10:19:41.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33368817?u=80d39153e27b7d191281ed9b12cfb2b414418080&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Summary</h3>
<p dir="auto">Update Firefox compatibility data for <code class="notranslate">appearance: base-select</code> and the single-dropdown customizable select subfeature.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Firefox bug 1974787 was fixed for Firefox 149 and added <code class="notranslate">appearance: base-select</code> behind <code class="notranslate">layout.css.appearance-base-select.enabled</code>. This updates the general <code class="notranslate">base-select</code> value and the single-dropdown subfeature with the corresponding preference flag.</p>
<p dir="auto">I left the listbox and multiple-dropdown subfeatures unchanged because the Firefox bug documents the customizable <code class="notranslate">&lt;select&gt;</code> value, but does not establish those separate subfeatures.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Tests</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">npm run lint -- css/properties/appearance.json</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">prettier --check css/properties/appearance.json</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">node -e "JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('css/properties/appearance.json','utf8')); console.log('valid json')"</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">git diff --check</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1974787" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1974787</a></li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4562221013" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44320" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/44320/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44320">mdn/content#44320</a></li>
</ul>]]></content>
